Package: claimtestR
Title: Test Statistical Claims as Executable Assertions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Andres", "Monreal", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "sircalch@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Provides small, composable assertions for testing scientific
    claims made from statistical results. Claims about direction, uncertainty,
    practical magnitude, equivalence, stability, and model improvement are
    represented by structured objects that can be inspected, summarized, and
    used in automated research workflows.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
